The desktop's recipe, which Linux builds and installs (install)

kwin/lujarch and kwin/kwin.patch are changes to KWin (https://invent.kde.org/plasma/kwin), licensed
under the GNU General Public License, version 2 or later
(https://spdx.org/licenses/GPL-2.0-or-later.html). The backend's structure follows the KWin backend
